    <briefdescription>
<para>Specialization of <ref refid="classllvm_1_1sandboxir_1_1_seed_bundle" kindref="compound">SeedBundle</ref> for memory access instructions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Keeps seeds sorted in ascending memory order, which is convenient for slicing these bundles into vectorizable groups. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
